# NOBODY'S LIGHTS (docs/HUSH.md H4): on a crags night in fog, one to three steady
# pale grey-green lights stand low in the fog 11 to 20 tiles off, and walking
# toward them brings them no nearer. From above (the nearest at the frame's
# edge), then over the shoulder turned toward it, then after walking at it.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/hush-lights.tour --seed=7 --hour=23 --weather=fog:0.7
place the_crags
coast calm
wait 1.5
await nobodys_light 3
near nobodys_light
wait 0.5
shot 01-nobodys-lights-from-above
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
near nobodys_light
wait 1.0
shot 02-nobodys-light-over-the-shoulder with shoulder
leap 5.0
wait 0.5
near nobodys_light
wait 0.8
shot 03-walked-at-it-and-it-is-as-far with shoulder
